WEBVTT

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.500
Eight minutes and twenty from your face to mine

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.620
everything I see of you is running behind

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.340
sprinklers on the driveway and the radio on

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:24.360
all of this light left before you were gone

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:29.700
We've been falling since the day we met

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.360
round and round and never landing yet

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:39.400
You went dark

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:44.460
but you didn't let go

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:49.220
all I see is your ghost

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:52.820
and I'm still falling for you

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.600
The far galaxies leave, going red as they go

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.240
the whole sky was burning once, now it barely glows

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:05.600
some of the snow on the TV is that light

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.460
thirteen point eight billion years of goodbye

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.500
We asked the dark, where is everybody?

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.540
one night in Ohio a signal, then Wow

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:19.840
and the sky never said it again

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:24.280
You went dark

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.800
but you didn't let go

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:34.040
all we see is your ghost

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:37.850
and we're still falling for you

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.040
Fall in slow

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.580
from out here you never go

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:49.900
you just stop at the edge and turn red

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:53.840
everything you were is written on the edge

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:57.400
nothing gets lost, we think

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.440
You went dark

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.720
but you didn't let go

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:06.760
all I see is your ghost

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:07.900
you went

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:10.860
DARK!

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:17.110
you didn't let go
